<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">RRK32.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">YONA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Yona</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">YONA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yona okutumwa Nineeve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:25">2 Bag 14:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Yona mwene Amitai, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:11">Kut 10:11</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:36">2 Bag 19:36</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat 12:41</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:5">Kush 18:5</ref>. </char></note> Imuka, oze Nineeve orurembo orwo ruhango, orurangire ebirirubaho; ahabw'okuba obubi bwarwo buhikire omu maisho gangye. <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:16">Kut 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:22">1 Bag 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:9">Zab 139:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 139:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:12">Ezk 27:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yona yaimuka kuhungira MUKAMA Tarushiishi, yaashuuma Yoopa, yaashangayo emeeri erikuza Tarushiishi; yaaha empiiha z'okumutwara, yaaza omu meeri kugyenda nabo Tarushiishi, ngu ahungye MUKAMA. <verse eid="JON 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 48:7">Zab 48:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:25">107:25</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA yaayohereza omuyaga mwingi aha nyanja, enyanja yaagira ebingonzi bingi, emeeri yaayenda kusheenyagurika. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:28">Zab 107:28</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:18">Byak 27:18</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 27:38">38</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo abarimbi baatiina, buri omwe yaatakira ruhanga we, n'ebintu ebyabaire biri omu meeri baabinaga omu nyanja kwanguhiza emeeri. Kwonka Yona we akaba yaagiire omu kicweka kyayo eky'omunda, abyami, ayegwejegyereire. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Omukuru w'emeeri nikwo kwija ah'ari, akamugira ati: Obaire ota, iwe mugwejegyezi 'we? Imuka, otakire ruhanga waawe. Obundi ruhanga waawe akaatwijuka, tureka kucwekyerera.<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Bwanyima baagambirana bati: Nimwije tuteere enteenyu, tubone kumanya otureeteire aka kabi. Batyo baateera enteenyu, yaakwata Yona. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Baamubuuza bati: Tugambire otureeteire aka kabi. Okora murimo ki? Nooruga hi? Owaanyu ni nkahi? Kandi ori owa ihanga ki? <verse eid="JON 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 146:6">Zab 146:6</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: Ndi Omuheburaayo, nintiina MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'omu iguru, owaahangire enyanja n'ensi. <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Okuruga aho baagira obwoba bwingi, baamubuuza bati: Beitu ekyo eki okozire niki? Ahabw'okuba abo bashaija bakamanya ku yaabaire ahungire MUKAMA; ahakuba akaba yaabagambiire.<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yona okunagwa omu nyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Baamubuuza bati: Mbwenu tukugire tuta, enyanja ekabona kutuuza, tukakira? Ahabw'okuba enyanja ekaba neeyeyongyera kuhinduriza. <verse eid="JON 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:20">Yos 7:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: Nimunkirize, munnagye omu nyanja; obwo nibwo enyanja eraatuuze, mukakira; ahabw'okuba nimmanya ngu eri ihunga ry'amaani eryabajuumikira niinye ryabatura. <verse eid="JON 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Kwonka abo bashaija baavuga munonga gu babone kuhitsya emeeri aha nkungu, baaremwa; ahabw'okuba enyanja ekaba neeyeyongyera kubatabangurira ebingonzi. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:3">Zab 115:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 21:8">Bir 21:8</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo baatakiriire MUKAMA, nibagira bati: Nitukweshengyereza, ai MUKAMA, otatureka tukahwerekyerera, tukazira ogu mushaija; kandi tukazira otatutaho orubanja rw'eshagama y'otaine rubanja; ahabw'okuba, ai MUKAMA, niiwe okozire nk'oku osiimire. <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:7">Zab 65:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:24">Luk 8:24</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baakiriza Yona, baamunaga omu nyanja, enyanja yaatuuza. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Ahonaaho abo bashaija baatiina munonga MUKAMA, baamutambira ebitambo, baahiga nibarahira.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:4">16:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaateekateeka eky'enyanja kihango kumira Yona; kyamumira, yaamara omunda y'ekyo ky'enyanja ebiro bishatu nyomushana na nyekiro.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okushaba kwa Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Bwanyima Yona yaashaba MUKAMA Ruhanga we, ari omunda y'eky'enyanja, naagira ati:<verse eid="JON 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:7">Zab 42:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:6">88:6</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 88:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'obusaasi ntakiire MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Yangarukamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Naataka ndi omunda y'Okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Waahurira eiraka ryangye.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 1:1">Amo 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba onnagire omu maizi maingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">Ahagati y'enyanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">Ago maizi gaanyehinguririza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:3">Ebingonzi byawe n'emijumba yaawe byona byandengyeraho.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:35">1 Bag 8:35</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 8:38">38</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:22">Zab 31:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntyo naagira nti: Ncwirwe omu maisho gaawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:4">Mbwenu ndyareeba nta hekalu yaawe erikwera obundi.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:1">Zab 69:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaizi ganshwekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">Amaizi maingi gaanyehinguririza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">Amarebe gaanyezingirira omu mutwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:5">Ahu enshozi zitsimbire emizi.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Zab 16:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:4">103:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naashuuma, naahika omu nsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Ei empimbi zaayo zinkingiraniire kimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Kwonka waiha amagara gangye omu Kiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:30">1 Bag 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:5">Zab 107:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142:3">142:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutima gwangye ku gwagwire enshazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">Naakwijuka, MUKAMA;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">Okushaba kwangye kwahika omuri hekalu yaawe erikwera.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:15">2 Bag 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:5">Yer 2:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abata omutima aha bishushani ebitaine mugasho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:8">Baba batsigireho Orikubasaasira.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:14">Zab 50:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka nyowe ndyakutambira ebitambo n'eiraka ry'okusiima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">Eki naahigire nindaganisa, ndyakihikiiriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">Okujuna n'okwa MUKAMA.<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yaaragiira ekyo ky'enyanja, kyatanaka Yona aha nkungu.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yona okubuurira Nineeve ngu beeteise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyaija ahari Yona obwa kabiri, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />Imuka, oze Nineeve, orurembo orwo oruhango, orugambire obutumwa obu ndikukutuma. <verse eid="JON 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Atyo Yona yaimuka, yaaza Nineeve, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamugambira. Kandi Nineeve rukaba ruri orurembo ruhango munonga, oru obuhango bwarwo burikugyenderwa ebiro bishatu. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Yona yaatandika kugyendagyenda omu rurembo, naagyenda orugyendo rw'eizooba rimwe; naagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Hatsigaire ebiro makumi ana, Nineeve ecwekyerezibwe. <verse eid="JON 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:3">2 Bus 20:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat 12:41</ref>. </char></note> Abantu ba Nineeve baikiriza Ruhanga; baaranga okwesiibyakwo, baajwara ebiguniya, okuruga aha mukuru okuhika aha muto.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:20">Yob 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:8">2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima egyo nkuru yaahika aha mugabe wa Nineeve, yaimuka omu kitebe kye, yaajuura bushuuti ye, yaayehumbika ebiguniya, yaashutama omu iju. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:26">Dan 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:14">Yoel 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="JON 4:11">Yon 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Yaaragiira kubuzya ekiragiro omuri Nineeve, ekirikugira kiti: Ahabw'ekiragiro ky'omugabe n'abakungu be, hatagira ekyatamira eky'okurya kyona, yaaba muntu, yaaba busyo bw'ente nari obw'entaama, bitarya n'obu kwakuba okunywa; <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:6">Isa 59:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:11">Yer 18:11</ref>. </char></note> kureka omuntu weena n'enyamaishwa yoona bihumbikwe ebiguniya, kandi abantu batakire munonga Ruhanga, buri muntu arekye omuhanda gwe omubi, n'obubisha oburi omu ngaro ze. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:22">2 Sam 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:14">Yoel 2:14</ref>. </char></note> N'oha orikumanya ngu, obundi Ruhanga takaayegarukamu, akareka ekiniga kye kingi, tukareka kuhwerekyerera?<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Ruhanga ku yaareebire eki baakora, n'oku baahinduka kureka emihanda yaabo emibi, yaayegarukamu, yaareka akabi aku yaagambire kubareetaho; tiyaakabareetaho.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s1">Okuguubwa kubi kwa Yona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Kwonka ekyo kyagwisa kubi munonga Yona, yaagira ekiniga. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:13">Yoel 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Yaashaba MUKAMA ati: Ai MUKAMA, eki tikyo naagambire, obu naabaire nkiri owaitu? Nikyo kyandeeteire kuhungira Tarushiishi; ahabw'okuba nkamanya ku ori Ruhanga ow'embabazi kandi orikusaasira, otarikurahuka kuguubwa kubi, oine rukundo etahinduka, kandi oyegarukamu okutareeta kabi. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:4">1 Bag 19:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo, ai MUKAMA, ninkweshengyereza, ihaho amagara gangye; haakiri nfe okukira okugumaho. <verse eid="JON 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati: Ebyo waakora gye okugira ekiniga? <verse eid="JON 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Bwanyima Yona yaaruga omu rurembo, yaashutama aha rubaju rwarwo rw'oburugwa-izooba, yaayeyombekyerayo akaju, yaakahungiramu omushana, okuhitsya ahu arireebera oku orurembo ruriba.<verse eid="JON 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Bwanyima MUKAMA Ruhanga yaaragiira omwongo kurandira ahu Yona yaabaire ari, gukamusangira aha mutwe kumutambira omushana ogwabaire nigumwita. Atyo Yona yaashemererwa munonga ahabw'ogwo mwongo. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Kwonka omu kasheeshe omushekye ku gwajugutsire, Ruhanga yaaragiira akakooko, kaarya ogwo mwongo, gwayoma. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 121:6">Zab 121:6</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba ku ryaturukire, Ruhanga yaaragiira omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba ogurikwomya, omushana gwateera omutwe gwa Yona, yaayenda kugwa enshazi, yaayeshabira okufa, naagira ati: Haakiri nfe okukira okugumaho. <verse eid="JON 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Kwonka Ruhanga yaagira Yona ati: Ebyo waakora gye okugira ekiniga ahabw'omwongo? Onu ati: Eego, naakora gye okugira ekiniga, nangwa eky'okuunyita. <verse eid="JON 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Noosaasibwa omwongo, ogu otarahendekyeire, ogu otaramerize, ogwayemerize nyekiro, gukagaruka gukooma ekindi kiro. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:7">Yon 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu noogira ngu tinkusaasiibwe Nineeve, orwo rurembo ruhango, orurimu abantu akasiriira kamwe n'obukumi bubiri n'okukiraho abatarikubaasa kutaanisa ndyo na mosho, kandi orurimu amatungo maingi?<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>